abstract: >
  Open pilot: replace ROME/MEMIT generic corpus covariance C with a
  resonance-weighted covariance (topology + asymmetric weak-to-strong
  budget transfer) on GPT-2-small. Real, reproducible layer sweeps and
  joint multi-fact scaling; honest negatives kept. Apache-2.0.
  Weights not redistributed. Not a COUNTERFACT/zsRE benchmark paper.
